Z||000000||WisconsinGT||05-21-2001||10:58 PM||||Hey all! I has problems with my car about two weeks ago. She died on me out in the country. Well, I bought a new control modual and she died again when I got home. So I thoght I would try a new coil. Went with the MSD Blaster coil. Wow, what a difference. I can actually feel my car pulling through all the gears. What a great feeling. Also, I no longer hear a tick,tick,tick when I am going 80mph on the interstate. (Could a coil stop that from happening?) I will never go with an Accel coil again. Thanks!||||reg||1
